      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 173,
      "exactOriginalText": "Already mid-action, Pip the rabbit tries to place one sticky note on the toy cabinet's empty front panel, but it clings to Pip's fingertip while the cabinet stays untouched."
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "S02-eddd77bfa3dd735f",
      "documentRole": "SOURCE",
      "documentSha256": "ba352d486c4252c5c6fefe585ad976c0b6f73c299f7554863848bdd842a99b3d",
      "startOffset": 173,
      "endOffset": 273,
      "exactOriginalText": " Pip tries to peel the note away with the free hand, but it splits into two notes, one on each hand."
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "S03-eddd77bfa3dd735f",
      "documentRole": "SOURCE",
      "documentSha256": "ba352d486c4252c5c6fefe585ad976c0b6f73c299f7554863848bdd842a99b3d",
      "startOffset": 273,
      "endOffset": 370,
      "exactOriginalText": " Pip tries to press both notes onto the cabinet, but they spring back and double into four notes."
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "S04-eddd77bfa3dd735f",
      "documentRole": "SOURCE",
      "documentSha256": "ba352d486c4252c5c6fefe585ad976c0b6f73c299f7554863848bdd842a99b3d",
      "startOffset": 370,
      "endOffset": 495,
      "exactOriginalText": " Pip tries to push the four notes off against the cabinet door edge, but they split into eight and cover Pip's arms and face."
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "S05-eddd77bfa3dd735f",
      "documentRole": "SOURCE",
      "documentSha256": "ba352d486c4252c5c6fefe585ad976c0b6f73c299f7554863848bdd842a99b3d",
      "startOffset": 495,
      "endOffset": 695,
      "exactOriginalText": " Pip sees the four-to-eight change finish, realizes that every removal or transfer attempt multiplies the notes, deliberately stops struggling, and turns the still note-covered face toward the mirror."
    },
    {
      "evidenceId": "S06-eddd77bfa3dd735f",
